{249}{This is Black Root! I was here a few years ago. It doesn't look like it's changed any since then. Hey!  We need to find a place called the Sour Barnacle.  My old gaffer used to swear it's the best tavern on the whole east coast. Lot's a salty old sea dogs, and ale strong enough to walk to you! Or so he said.}{This is Black Root! I was here a few years ago. It doesn't look like it's changed any since then. Hey!  We need to find a place called the Sour Barnacle.  My old gaffer used to swear it's the best tavern on the whole east coast. Lot's a salty old sea dogs, and ale strong enough to walk to you! Or so he said.}{}{}{}{}
