{257}{[Wrinko looks around confusedly.]  Eh? Uh...yes!  This is Dernholm, in Cumbria. It's the capital city. Somehow... [He pauses for a moment] I've heard it had fallen on hard times but everything I've ever read said this was a pretty nice place. How could the King have let it become like this?}{[Wrinko looks around confusedly.]  Eh? Uh...yes!  This is Dernholm, in Cumbria. It's the capital city. Somehow... [He pauses for a moment] I've heard it had fallen on hard times but everything I've ever read said this was a pretty nice place. How could the King have let it become like this?}{}{}{}{}
