{269}{And this would be Roseborough!  This is where that Arronax fella got his butt shipped off to the Void. Banished, they called it. From what I've heard, it's better than he deserved. Anyway, they've got a big fancy inn here and a huge stone ring to mark the spot where Arronax was banished. I don't recall read about much beyond those two things though. Can we go see the ring?!}{And this would be Roseborough!  This is where that Arronax fella got his butt shipped off to the Void. Banished, they called it. From what I've heard, it's better than he deserved. Anyway, they've got a big fancy inn here and a huge stone ring to mark the spot where Arronax was banished. I don't recall read about much beyond those two things though. Can we go see the ring?!}{}{}{}{}
