{273}{[Looking around uneasily] Oh, my... We're on  the Isle of Despair. My ma used to warn us young'ns that if we didn't behave this is where we'd wind up. May I suggest you conclude your business here as soon as possible so we can get the $#@% out of here? }{[Looking around uneasily] Oh, my... We're on  the Isle of Despair. My ma used to warn us young'ns that if we didn't behave this is where we'd wind up. May I suggest you conclude your business here as soon as possible so we can get the $#@% out of here?  Please pardon my language.}{}{}{}{}
