{280}{Ah, this is the big town of Brandybuck. It's your typical farming community - our claim to fame being that our sheep have the softest wool in all of Arcanum. If you like quiet little places, then this would be perfect. Once a year, a travelling fair comes through - that's the promoter over there in the commons. Haven't seen the rest of them though. They're usually here by now.}{Ah, this is the big town of Brandybuck. It's your typical farming community - our claim to fame being that our sheep have the softest wool in all of Arcanum. If you like quiet little places, then this would be perfect. Once a year, a travelling fair comes through - that's the promoter over there in the commons. Haven't seen the rest of them though. They're usually here by now.}{}{}{}{}
